                                "sense_id": "e811b67e-5ac8-3a53-98c8-f227f09d597b",
                                "text": "That is a very large question, and I do not propose to go into it in any detail; but from such figures as I have been able to obtain, I am bound to say that it does appear that there has been not only a diminution, as was pointed out by the Committee, in the barrelage of beer brewed in the United Kingdom, but also in the consumption of spirits."
